"features) available on the system this store uses to build derivations."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-store.md:170
msgid "Example: `\"kvm\"`"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-store.md:172
msgid "**Default:** _machine-specific_"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-store.md:174
msgid ""
