"trusted)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-store.md:176
msgid ""
"Whether paths from this store can be used as substitutes even if they are "
"not signed by a key listed in the [`trusted-public-keys`](../../command-ref/"
"conf-file.md#conf-trusted-public-keys) setting."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-store.md:183
msgid ""
"<span id=\"store-local-store-use-roots-daemon\">[`use-roots-daemon`](#store-"
"local-store-use-roots-daemon)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-store.md:200
msgid "Whether to request garbage collector roots from an external daemon."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-store.md:202
msgid ""
"When enabled, the garbage collector connects to a Unix domain socket at "
"[`<state-dir>`](../../store/types/local-store.md#store-local-store-state)`/"
"gc-roots-socket/socket` to discover additional roots that should not be "
"collected. This is useful when the Nix daemon runs without root privileges "
"and cannot scan `/proc` for runtime roots."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/local-store.md:207
msgid ""
"The daemon can be started with [`nix store roots-daemon`](../../command-ref/"
"new-cli/nix3-store-roots-daemon.md)."
msgstr ""

